{"path":"io/basic_streambuf/sputc","title":"std::basic_streambuf<CharT,Traits>::sputc","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_streambuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>sputc","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/sputc","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Writes one character to the output sequence.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">int_type sputc<span class=\"br0\">(</span> char_type ch <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Writes one character to the output sequence.\n</p><p>If the output sequence write position is not available (the buffer is full), then calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">overflow<span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  character to write\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The written character, converted to <code>int_type</code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">to_int_type</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> on success.\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">eof</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> (as returned by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/overflow\">overflow()</a></span>) on failure.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>a</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/sputn\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sputn</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">xsputn<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_streambuf","title":"std::basic_streambuf"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_streambuf<CharT,Traits>::sputc","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Writes one character to the output sequence."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ch"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The written character, converted to int_type with Traits::to_int_type(ch) on success."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"sputn","note":"invokes xsputn()"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":80,"codeBlockCount":2}
